Package: vibewidget
Title: Interactive Notebook Widgets Generated from Plain English
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Vibe Widget", "Maintainers", email = "hello@vibewidget.dev", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generate interactive, LLM-authored notebook widgets from a
    natural-language description and a data.frame, and render them inline
    in Positron, RStudio, Quarto, and R Markdown. A thin R client of the
    'vibe_widget' Python engine (run in-process via 'reticulate', with no
    Jupyter kernel involved): widget generation, revision ("grab-edit"),
    and repair run over a small local WebSocket bridge in Python threads,
    so the R session is never blocked pumping an event loop, and rendered
    'Quarto' output falls back to a fully static, self-contained artifact.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
